                "question": "How do you balance hardness and toughness for shredder components?",
                "answer": "This is a genuine metallurgical trade-off \u2014 higher hardness improves abrasive wear resistance but can reduce toughness (impact fracture resistance), so we work with equipment manufacturers to understand their specific expected material stream and application to select the appropriate balance for each component."
