                "question": "What is a binary cycle geothermal plant?",
                "answer": "Binary cycle plants use geothermal heat to warm a secondary working fluid with a lower boiling point through a heat exchanger, generating power from lower-temperature geothermal resources than direct steam flash technology can utilize \u2014 we supply forged nozzle and flange components for this heat exchanger equipment."
