                "question": "What certification do you provide for aluminum smelter equipment forgings?",
                "answer": "EN 10204 3.1 material test certificates as standard, with 3.2 third-party witnessed certification available on request for smelter EPC contractors and equipment manufacturers requiring independent documentation."
